Name: ink-graphic-novel - example (stark night)
Columns: 4
# One instance of the colour structure in style.md (demo.html's 'night' palette). Never ship it as
# is: every game re-chooses each role for its own tone. demo.html's 'pulp' (bright daytime) and
# 'noir' (grey) palettes fill the same roles and pass the same rules.
# Checked (value = HSV V, chroma = S x V, contrast = WCAG ratio, huedist = hue difference):
#   8 colours; ink value 0.06; ink on paper 15.6:1
#   field values 0.24 < 0.45 < 0.76, step contrast 1.97, 3.03; field-1 on ink 1.36:1; field-3 on ink 8.1:1
#   field chroma max 0.20; paper chroma 0.12
#   accent chroma 0.73 (field max 0.20); accent at least 175 deg from every field hue; accent on ink 8.5:1
#   ink on signals 6.3:1, 11.3:1; accent 41 and 107 deg from the signals
